Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 06:16:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] perf(model): build show block transform once per slot

The pose for a TransformData is identical for every quad, so push and build it once per slot instead of per quad, reuse one Vector4f and a constant direction array. The same float operations run in the same order, so vertices are bit-identical.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TD7PJ5R7t7hM3ymeeqXP4H
